                        <hr size='1' width='100%' color='#000000'><a name="entry204"></a>

                        <span id='postcolor'>Hi&#33; I&#39;m your resident code-monkey for the rest of this websites&#39; existance. <br><br>I&#39;ve conjured up some new shiny stuff for OE to use - you may find it here: <a href="http://www.theoutwardeye.com/eqs/" target="_blank">http://www.theoutwardeye.com/eqs/</a><br><br>It&#39;s still being worked on, so pardon the dust.<br><br>For everyone that&#39;s wondering what the heck it is; it&#39;s a full list of <b>ALL</b> spells in EverQuest, including GM-only spells, bugged spells, and weapon effects. Joy.<br><br>All wrapped together in a searchable interface. Now you won&#39;t have to endure Casters Realm&#39;s ads anymore, you can just look everything up on your one-stop-EQ-shop - this website.<br><br>Enjoy, and if you find anything odd - post a reply to this post so I can see it and fix it <!--emo&:D--><img src="http://www.theoutwardeye.com/iB_html/non-cgi/emoticons/biggrin.gif" border="0" valign="absmiddle" alt=':D'><!--endemo-->  </span>

